{"version":1,"key":"article:38","content":{"id":38,"title":"连续时间信号的抽样及其重建","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"现研究一连续信号进行抽样转换为数字信号，经数字信号处理器(DSP)或计算机处理后，再进行重建的过程，具体过程如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b3ac93b8-0a69-4b50-9ba3-326e18029380","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"84201e16-caa7-4005-bd73-f6c75192b0e7","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86_1ac8fdfb-a28d-4756-9029-532d98332239.png"},{"children":[{"text":"其中采样/保持电路和 A/D 转换电路可以看做是一个理想抽样的过程，而 D/A 转换和平滑滤波可以看做是一个理想内插的过程。假设理想抽样信号为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fe94976e-4ea8-4c95-bca0-fb0fbc6846b5","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2ae8e1a0-5b12-4c59-92a8-158f6395e9d8","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\delta(t-nT_{s})","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"其中","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"T_s","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ec2734e0-4fe4-4fcb-9ab2-3ad990149000","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"T_s","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"为抽样的周期。那么模拟信号 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"x_a(t)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6398a661-6841-4724-86a5-7d2e5f792566","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x_a(t)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"经理想抽样后得到的抽样信号 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\hat{x}\\_a(t)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fd846f18-a8fc-4414-9d4a-2ff1b4e15f16","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\hat{x}_a(t)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"611840b9-84b5-42e4-8a61-9ddea87fc211","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"708a0ddb-f817-4056-8cfc-283b2583e20e","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\hat{x}_a(t)=x_a(t) \\cdot \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta(t-nT_s)","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"设信号","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"x_a(t)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"47305b58-90a8-40f3-a288-f9b3c8d53e1c","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x_a(t)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"的傅里叶变换为","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"X_a(j\\Omega)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cc9188cd-9986-4808-90d5-70c888b9f7f8","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"X_a(j\\Omega)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"并且其最高频率为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\Omega_m","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d3a5613e-d16a-43ad-bbaf-d1b3a30c171c","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\Omega_m","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，现研究抽样信号 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\hat{x}_a(t)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"17735ba6-57b8-48fd-8e34-b4735eb69950","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\hat{x}_a(t)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"的傅里叶变换","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e5437503-d94b-485f-8ea1-e58be1081235","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e78d28cd-29c8-4a81-9123-84a5d86fdf16","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\hat{X}_a(j\\Omega)=F[\\hat{x}_a(t)]&=F[x_a(t) \\cdot \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta(t-nT_s)] \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{2\\pi}X(j\\Omega)*\\frac{2\\pi}{T_s}\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta(\\Omega - n\\Omega_s) \\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{T_s}\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}X(j(\\Omega - n\\Omega_s))\n\\end{aligned}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"其中 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\Omega_s=\\dfrac{2\\pi}{T_s}","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a10b537e-ec39-4b13-b849-b3bc849e5e15","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\Omega_s=\\dfrac{2\\pi}{T_s}","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"。从上式中就可以看出抽样信号的频谱是原信号频谱的周期延拓。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5f628a67-78ac-4698-8854-a764aad178f2","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cae2f022-5823-4ce5-97a1-396a154618ad","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6ccf037c-9781-48d3-ab21-3bdfe90c1eea.png"},{"children":[{"text":"要保证频谱在周期延拓时不发生混叠，那么就要求","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b6fb8b6e-e770-4cf8-8d27-d3557fc3d54a","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"04ad1802-e17e-47e4-9f2c-0e892b9f1cb4","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\Omega_s-\\Omega_m\\geq\\Omega_m \\Rightarrow\\Omega_s\\geq2\\Omega_m","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"把 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\Omega_s=2\\Omega_m","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7d9ea8f0-e6fb-4448-a29a-6d761c2bfd6e","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\Omega_s=2\\Omega_m","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 称为奈奎斯特采样频率，这是频谱不发生混叠允许的最小采样频率，此时可以通过一低通滤波器将信号恢复出来，若频谱发生了混叠，则很难将信号重建出来。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e119329a-e51c-451b-bb80-5606759d04df","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"考虑信号的重建，由频谱图可知，通过一低通滤波器即可将信号完全的恢复出来，假设以频率 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"\\Omega_s>2\\Omega_m","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ed59dbf5-57df-4f22-b076-9cf142134611","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\Omega_s>2\\Omega_m","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 进行抽样，考虑这么一个低通滤波器：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b6758f75-ad69-491a-a4b6-79bc3419270b","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6e9a544b-329f-4d8e-b6ec-ef42f0b0dfb2","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/lp_b48dd351-c275-4312-83c7-54e2121017a5.png"},{"children":[{"text":"其傅里叶反变换为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2f53181d-4a47-4e02-b6c8-d6bfc5d6be43","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"79186bc4-221a-4cf9-861c-387ff9981832","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"h_{LP}(t) = \\text{sinc}(\\frac{t}{T_s})","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"其中 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"sinc(t)=\\dfrac{sin(\\pi t)}{\\pi t}","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d75f256a-05f8-4ec8-b9a4-1ea6475d64d7","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\text{sinc}(t)=\\dfrac{\\sin(\\pi t)}{\\pi t}","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，由频谱关系知","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dcd85e9b-312b-4f4f-808a-253222a94adc","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ac998f5e-9bd7-43a8-988b-d8bb012a9cb8","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"X(j\\Omega)=\\hat{X}_a(j\\Omega) \\cdot H_{LP}(j\\Omega)","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"所以","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2940b69c-87fb-4bde-8048-8ada8695323f","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"915e765b-7653-4438-95a3-6d0f3917a622","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx_a(t)&=\\hat{x}_a(t) * h_{LP}(t) \\\\\n&=x_a(t) \\cdot \\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta(t-nT_s) * h_{LP}(t) \\\\\n&=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x_a(nT_s)\\delta(t-nT_s) * \\text{sinc}(\\frac{t}{T_s}) \\\\\n&=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x_a(nT_s) \\cdot \\text{sinc}(\\frac{1}{T_s}(t-nT_s))\n\\end{aligned}","type":"block-math"},{"children":[{"text":"这就是信号的重建，这个过程也被称为理想内插过程。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"07d15834-231e-4d01-bfb4-6c9112235b08","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-wq2k9r_462a1f3e-3c48-4007-983a-8461db1451c2.jpg","createTime":1543154529000,"updateTime":1793532529783},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1793532529783}}